      "maxStacks": 1,
      "exclusive": false,
      "enabledByDefault": false,
      "description_raw": "Increases DEF by 16%. Casting Resonance Skill restores 8 points of Concerto Energy. This effect can be triggered 1 every 20s. When the wielder heals Resonators, increases Crit. DMG of all nearby Resonators in the team by 20% for 4s. Effects of the same name cannot be stacked."
